The wrapper in this repository is licensed under the Apache License, Version
2.0, in LICENSE. It contains no Grok Build source. assets/agent.md names
Grok Build's tool ids, and the proxy quotes the opening of Grok Build's
summary prompt to recognize compaction requests.

